      "side": 1,
      "message": "In-place update currently changes only threshold values for existing sensors and then continues. That means non-threshold configuration changes (for example poll rate, read state, or other runtime parameters) are not reapplied on rescan for already-created sensors. Is this intentional?",
      "revId": "2e7de3b6fc7cd42b8a5c56c8c00560ca98898005",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
