      "writtenOn": "2026-07-27T10:33:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If parseThresholdsFromConfig fails in this in-place path, the code still removes the entry from sensorsChanged and continues. That can silently keep stale thresholds and also suppress retry/recreate on this rescan. Should we keep the change pending or fall back to full sensor recreate when parsing fails?",
